Portfolio Scenarios
THE SCENARIO ENGINE

This should be one of AlphaInvest's flagship features.

User:

"What happens to my portfolio if NIFTY falls 20%?"

AlphaInvest:

NIFTY -20%


Estimated portfolio impact
        ↓
      -14.7%


Highest impact:
1. Banking
2. Small Cap
3. High Beta stocks


Risk:
HIGH


Expected recovery requirement:
+17.2%

Other scenarios:

Oil +30%
Interest rates +2%
USD/INR +10%
IT sector -20%
Banking sector -30%
Global recession
India-specific crisis
Market -50%
